 "named_limitations": [
  "Profiles are of one warmed eager forward per bucket (roofline session captures at a903d517c6, verified: 12x10, sdpa_nofp32acc, signposts); traced op-to-op gaps are not profiled, so the traced dispatch residual is wall - device kernel sum.",
  "Two roofline numbers: the op-table floor (prefill_op_table.py, 120 cores, padded tensors once, 512 GB/s) and the roofline session's model (roofline/roofline.py: FPU / SFPU / DRAM at 89 % matmul efficiency, 450 GB/s, cold, 1.35 GHz); % of roofline uses the latter. Both are models.",
  "Sustained = max(30 s, 300 replays), one sustained run per bucket; repeats only for 512 / 2048 / 8192 (ctl12) and 32768 (ctl12_32768).",
  "From 16384 up the sustained AICLK drops to 1293 / 1237 / 1193 MHz (stage 1 at 13x10, p3_qkv_gu: 1325 / 1312 / 1306); burst at those buckets is not a full-clock number.",
  "One card (P150a, default 150 W TDP limit) emulating the Galaxy 12x10 grid; a Galaxy chip itself (power, clock, PCIe) is not measured.",
  "The E5a fallback text precision crashes at 12x10 in multi-bucket sessions <= 8192 (open item for stage 5); not measured here.",
  "No unmasked path: none exists with a caller contract."
 ],
